<title>FRANCE: Rouen April 1-9 wheat exports 114,842 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen April 1-9 wheat exports 114,842 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached 114,842 tonnes between April 1 and April 9, port officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 373,000 tonnes for the whole of April 1996.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   32,700</p>
<p>    Britain			  6,267</p>
<p>    Italy			   75,875</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
